A 2021 arXiv research paper by Yibo Gao, Daoji Huang. We present a direct bijection between reduced pipe dreams and reduced bumpless pipe dreams by interpreting reduced compatible sequences on bumpless pipe dreams and show that this bijection preserves Monk’s formula, establishing its canonical nature. Introduction

